    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a complete shutdown... that sounds almost impossible. like, i don't even know what that would look like. i just feel so heavy and everything is so loud. what do you mean by a controlled removal? like, how do you actually even get to a place where the input just... stops? like, for real?",
